{"title":"2026 AMC 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2026 AMC 8</b> problems and solutions. <b>The test was held from January 22 to 30, 2026, after a two-day window extension due to a severe winter storm.</b> The first link contains the full set of test problems. The second link contains the answer key. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"2026_AMC8_.28Standard.29_Version\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2026_AMC8_(Standard)_Version\">2026 AMC8 (Standard) Version</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: 2026 AMC8 (Standard) Version\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Answer Key\">2026 AMC 8 Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></li>\n<li